{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "bds_max_density",
  "spec": ["building-development 4.7.4", "building-development 4.7.1", "building-development 11.10"],
  "description": "Test 10, by hand from 4.7.4 with float32 steps (cell width 16; the table is built once per process, so each case uses a fresh process). A 2 x 3 lot (area 6, 32 x 48 m) allowing zone 1 with one residential $ building (key 4 + 1 + 1 = 6) of capacity 20, 16 x 16 m at the lot centre: d = r24(r24(20 / 6) + 0.5) = 3.8333333 (0x40755555) -> GetMaxCapacity(1, 1, 1) = float(trunc) = 3.0. Capacity 2 -> 0.8333334 < 1 with capacity > 0 -> 1.0 -> 1.0. Capacity 0 -> 0.5 kept -> 0.0. Capacity 5 on a 1 x 2 lot -> 2.5 + 0.5 = 3.0. A second configuration giving 2.0 (capacity 9 on 2 x 3) for the same key leaves 3.8333333, in either order. Unknown key -> 0.0. Extras in one process: a family ID expands to its members (zones 2, 3); orientation 1 swaps the occupant size: a 16 x 40 commercial $ building (key 10, capacity 30) at (24, 16) of a 3 x 2 lot does not fit unrotated (top = 16 - 20 + 0.001 < 0) but fits rotated -> 5.5 for zone 4 only; a 40 m wide building does not fit a 32 m lot; purpose 0 is skipped; a configuration without a primary object adds nothing [choice]; a profile whose capacity table lacks its own developer type has capacity 0 -> 0.5; an ID that is neither a family nor a building adds nothing [inferred]; a building exactly as large as the lot fits (0 + 0.001 >= 0, 32 - 0.001 <= 32) -> 12 / 6 + 0.5 = 2.5, one 32.004 m wide does not (32.002 - 0.001 > 32).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [{"building": "0x1000", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 20, "size": [16, 10, 16]}]},
    {"op": "bds_lot_configs", "list": [{"size": [2, 3], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1000"]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [[1, 6, 3.8333333]]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [1, 1, 1], "expect": 3.0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [2, 1, 1], "expect": 0.0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [1, 2, 1], "expect": 0.0},

    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [{"building": "0x1000", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 2, "size": [16, 10, 16]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [[1, 6, 1.0]]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [1, 1, 1], "expect": 1.0},

    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [{"building": "0x1000", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 0, "size": [16, 10, 16]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [[1, 6, 0.5]]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [1, 1, 1], "expect": 0.0},

    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [{"building": "0x1000", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 5, "size": [8, 10, 8]}]},
    {"op": "bds_lot_configs", "list": [{"size": [1, 2], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1000"]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [[1, 6, 3.0]]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [1, 1, 1], "expect": 3.0},

    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [
      {"building": "0x1000", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 20, "size": [16, 10, 16]},
      {"building": "0x1001", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 9, "size": [16, 10, 16]}]},
    {"op": "bds_lot_configs", "list": [
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1000"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1001"]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [[1, 6, 3.8333333]]},
    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_lot_configs", "list": [
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1001"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1000"]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [[1, 6, 3.8333333]]},

    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [
      {"building": "0x1000", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 20, "size": [16, 10, 16], "families": ["0x7000"]},
      {"building": "0x3000", "purpose": 2, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 30, "size": [16, 5, 40]},
      {"building": "0x5000", "purpose": 3, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 10, "size": [40, 5, 8]},
      {"building": "0x6000", "purpose": 0, "wealth": 0, "capacity": 50, "size": [8, 5, 8]},
      {"building": "0x6100", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "size": [8, 5, 8], "props": {"0x27812834": {"u32": [4128, 77]}}},
      {"building": "0x6200", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 12, "size": [32, 5, 48]},
      {"building": "0x6300", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 12, "size": [32.004, 5, 48]}]},
    {"op": "bds_lot_configs", "list": [
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [1], "ids": ["0x1000"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [2, 3], "ids": ["0x7000"]},
      {"size": [3, 2], "zones": [5], "ids": ["0x3000"], "orientation": 0, "pos": [24, 16]},
      {"size": [3, 2], "zones": [4], "ids": ["0x3000"], "orientation": 1, "pos": [24, 16]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [6], "ids": ["0x5000"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [7], "ids": ["0x6000"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [9], "no_object": true},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [10], "ids": ["0x6100"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [11], "ids": ["0x9999"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [12], "ids": ["0x6200"]},
      {"size": [2, 3], "zones": [13], "ids": ["0x6300"]}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "density", "expect": [
      [1, 6, 3.8333333], [2, 6, 3.8333333], [3, 6, 3.8333333], [4, 10, 5.5], [10, 6, 0.5], [12, 6, 2.5]]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [4, 2, 1], "expect": 5.0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [5, 2, 1], "expect": 0.0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [10, 1, 1], "expect": 0.0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "max_capacity", "args": [12, 1, 1], "expect": 2.0},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "profile", "args": ["0x6100"], "expect": {"purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 0, "size": [8, 5, 8]}},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "profile_ptr", "args": ["0x9999"], "expect": null}
  ]
}
